Package: aegis-suite
Version: __VERSION__
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Aegis <ops@aegis.local>
Installed-Size: __SIZE__
Depends: aegis (= __VERSION__), kraken (= __VERSION__)
Suggests: aegis-agent
Description: Aegis and Kraken complete server suite (metapackage)
 Installs both independent server stacks through their normal packages. Aegis
 and Kraken keep separate databases, Redis instances, secrets and systemd
 units. The endpoint agent is deliberately not a dependency: it belongs on
 Windows/Linux endpoints and needs its own short-lived enrollment token.
Homepage: https://github.com/Terminalkid09/aegis-ecosystem
